-- 판매 00001 | [6] 주문 00002 불러오기 + 직접 행 추가 (작성 후 수정 없음)
INSERT INTO SALE (
    SALE_ID, SALE_NO, BUSINESS_DATE, PARTNER_ID, PARTNER_NAME, WAREHOUSE_ID, WAREHOUSE_NAME, ASSIGNEE_ID,
    ASSIGNEE_NAME, NOTE, PROGRESS_STATUS, CREATED_AT, UPDATED_AT
)
SELECT SEQ_SALE.NEXTVAL, LPAD(TO_CHAR(SEQ_SALE.NEXTVAL), 5, '0'), DATE '2026-09-05',
       (SELECT PARTNER_ID FROM BIZ_PARTNER WHERE PARTNER_CODE = '00003'), '대한전자',
       (SELECT WAREHOUSE_ID FROM WAREHOUSE WHERE WAREHOUSE_CODE = '00001'), '본사창고',
       (SELECT ASSIGNEE_ID FROM ASSIGNEE WHERE ASSIGNEE_CODE = '00003'), '박민수',
       '주문 00002 일부 판매 + 마우스 직접 추가', 'CONFIRMED',
       TIMESTAMP '2026-09-05 10:15:00', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-05 10:15:00'
FROM DUAL;

